# T2a harness: the new runner commands (dump, wait-bar, events/eventsstop) and the new
# expect keys (bar, beat, key, button). The sample counter is the only clock, so every
# value here is deterministic.
wait 300
# T7a: enter the classic X0X pages (GLOBAL -> Classic patterns).
tap GLO
tap SEL
expect view 1
# the button LEDs of the 909 screen: EDIT bright (this is the part), SAVE dark
expect button EDIT 1
expect button SAVE 0
# a white key writes a step; while stopped it lights bright, an unused white key stays dark
tapkey w0
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect key 0 2
expect key 2 0
# events: every engine command from here, with its sample time
events harness_events.txt
param 0 0 0 64
tapkey b0
eventsstop
# transport: PLAY; the 909's length is the bar
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait-bar 1
expect bar 1
expect beat <4
expect step <16
shot harness_playing.png
dump transport.json
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
